+An optional `DVI_AUDIO_800X480` mode uses a 400x240 RGB565 canvas (187.5 KiB)
+or an 800-pixel scanline callback. The timing is 1000x525 total at 60 Hz,
+with a 31.5 MHz pixel clock, negative HSYNC/VSYNC and VIC 0. Its aspect metadata
+is unspecified because 800x480 is neither the CTA 4:3 nor 16:9 format.
+Construct `Adafruit_DVI_Audio_GFX16 dvi(DVI_AUDIO_800X480);`, or call
