+The default constructor and two-argument callback `begin()` retain 640x480.
+Select the mode before starting core 1; changing it requires a reboot.
+This mode sets clk_sys to 315 MHz and the core regulator to 1.20 V; the
+315 MHz overclock is experimental and is not qualified on every RP2350 board.
